    "Pending READ and active WRITE complete once with IOERR_SELFTEST after a confirmed STOP. Exactly 64 source bytes remain accepted. Unquiesced STOP retains pending READ and display ownership at reset-required park.",
    "Text-only raw/optimized presentation remains an exact regression control."
